.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/activate-knowledge-blocks.md","line":54},{"title":"Components installed with knowledge blocks","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/components-installed-with-knowledge-blocks.md","line":54},{"title":"article versioning","target":"article-versioning","line":56},{"title":"Disable the article versioning feature","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/article-versioning-disable-property.md","line":56},{"title":"Knowledge Management","target":"knowledge-management","line":56},{"title":"Enable knowledge blocks in the Knowledge Center","target":"kc-enable-knowledge-blocks","line":60},{"title":"Create a knowledge block in the Knowledge Center","target":"kc-create-a-knowledge-block","line":61},{"title":"Add a knowledge block to a knowledge article","target":"kc-add-knowledge-blocks-to-a-knowledge-article","line":62},{"title":"Edit a knowledge block in a knowledge article","target":"kc-edit-knowledge-block-in-a-knowledge-article","line":63},{"title":"Knowledge blocks","target":"knowledge-blocks","line":64},{"title":"Create a knowledge article","target":"create-knowledge-article","line":65},{"title":"Knowledge Management","target":"knowledge-management","line":66},{"title":"Article versioning","target":"article-versioning","line":67}],"metadata":{"title":"Knowledge blocks in Knowledge Center","description":"Knowledge blocks are reusable pieces of content secured by customizable user criteria that you can add to knowledge articles in a knowledge base. The user criteria determine which user roles can or can’t read the block content in an article, enabling only relevant content to be visible to that user.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/servicenow-platform/kc-knowledge-bloc